0 Equinox - Differential lab
0 Name: equinox-differential.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/equinox-differential.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // Original Equinox design assembled with OpenAI assistance.
0 // New native PlacedModel exported by the unchanged Brickwright serializeModel function.
0 // Application Author is the native serializer default; design provenance is stated above.
0 // Stock five-bevel differential; A drives the carrier, B/C only coast or hold the outputs.
0 // Stock differential geometry follows the native Brickwright reference; frame and indicators are original.
0 // No custom constraints, collision edits or scripted output poses.
0 // Companion: equinox-differential.bw. Robot Lab Plain; open model, then Code > To blocks.
0 // Reset the complete model before running and before repeating the demonstration.
0 // Educational differential bench; physical assembly and hardware performance untested.
